WEBVTT

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.450
Hi Jason, my name is Travis Stephenson
with Rapid Studios.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.270
We built this mobile concept

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.050
to help your users act faster.

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:08.480
From a deal alert,

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.280
they can review the numbers,

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.450
save a fit,

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.380
and keep moving.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.700
I'd propose an iOS and Android pilot

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.310
for fifteen thousand dollars,

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:18.350
pending integration review.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.500
Worth a walkthrough?

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.000
[Music]
Rapid Studios · rapidstudios.dev
